| Run | mAP@50 | mAP@50–95 | CBB | CBSD | CGM | CMD | HEALTHY |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| EXP-0 30ep | 33.40 | 24.08 | 20.07 | 24.45 | 25.09 | 21.11 | 29.71 |
